<title>UK: Bodycote buys two U.S. testing laboratories.</title>
<headline>Bodycote buys two U.S. testing laboratories.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bodycote International Plc said on Thursday that it has bought Industrial Testing Laboratories Inc. and Metal Analysis Inc. for a total of 1.72 million stg.</p>
<p>The British engineering services company said that both purchases are U.S. companies are engaged in metallurgical testing.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
